                        "review": "Going through my huge backlog of games, surprised to see this one.  Not something I would buy, so I guess it came in as a big bundle sale pack.  \r\n\r\nIt wasn't terrible. It was OK during the hour I sampled it, something to do while watching sports etc.  Its game mechanic is sloppy and non-intuiitive, so that is the primary source of the challenge.  The puzzles themselves are pretty trivial, at least for the first 4-5 levels.   I would not have bought this intentionally, so I cannot recommend.",
